<h2>Questions from Hastings property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can older wood siding be repaired instead of replaced?</summary><div class="a"><p>Sometimes. It depends on availability of matching material and the extent of damage. Matching is a frequent appraisal topic.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you work on downtown commercial buildings?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes, including brick buildings with flat or low-slope roof systems.</p></div></details></div>
